      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-body-sm text-muted list-disc pl-5">
        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNbG9NVXc3dG53bTRzZmlSMmxfem1tNXFVRDJ3NzFmOFFGVFJzZWN5aWQtbVdjVjhqMkVYQjFpeFNfdG44blN2Wk5zUF9kSVNQZUtnblpILTViRzlaRlotNzJKT1c3RjgyMnpSbW9PaFpZeVBGdjY4ZzJUSi1xWmE3dWx0djFMcjdyWGxxclhrY2t2b3lkTkpjUTltLXkzS1Q1eVJIa2ZfYw?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Battwoo: baterias EV de segunda vida para armazenamento solar a 30% menos custo</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/09/21/malaysia-sets-fixed-grid-charge-10-year-contracts-for-corporate-solar/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Malásia define carga fixa na rede e contratos de 10 anos para solar corporativo — PV Magazine</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/09/21/chinese-scientists-build-33-3-efficient-perovskite-silicon-tandem-solar-cell-processed-in-ambient-air/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cientistas chineses constroem célula solar de silício-perovskita com 33,3% de eficiência — PV Magazine</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://cleantechnica.com/2026/09/21/norways-electric-ferries-could-find-a-big-market-in-the-philippines/" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Frotas elétricas da Noruega podem encontrar grande mercado nas Filipinas — CleanTechnica</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.marinelink.com/news/saudi-gulf-oil-exports-pick-pipeline-543132" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Exportações de petróleo do Golfo Pérsico aumentam após ataque a pipeline — MarineLink</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.marinelink.com/news/tanker-shuttles-keep-hormuz-oil-moving-543115" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Navios-tanque mantêm movimentação no Estreito de Ormuz — MarineLink</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxNMjJjT25qSWVZdzdUcEdXWHc1WFVSZVVBNHBSR0R4ZDF0X080TkVuTmVxS0tKUUJsdzJ5SXRiSmVQYnJNYURiYjhIWlo0UEFLSTVORDRJaWdaMXkxeFBfNWxocy1GWm1TT3pnR1diUzQyMmxaYTZWZGVCWC10dGplS3pvUEJXTW9JY2VOMTA0a2VNUGhWNHVvTW42VlV4VUlXcmhXSWhuX3RYUVpmM0dzbmw3Mi1aSXFvdkF3V3pLRUdpRWtkMTZ3Ug?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dragonfly Energy parceira com Sphere Energy para desenvolver tecnologia de baterias de próxima geração com IA</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Panasonic Energy inaugura centro global de pesquisa e desenvolvimento de baterias</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPNU16M0UtbFFHaWRtQnZYRjcxWk8yc3R0NUkxU21aUW5IN3NDQllpUlZYeVJYNFFRZl9Pa2s0VFU1RW1uWVJuNDRPRVJDdnVzYnh4X0VxdVhrY3cxSGtaQzgyRUNvbVIzUnpGbktRY29CLXhoZ1hjdDhDZlhfWldqbjVFZFdmUm5ZX2FYR3FCeTNpNEdkUnFDUlVia3UxNEp4dDQ2TkNobE1wUW83Qmt5Mlc2M0FfRWVydnRhdURYSjRkZw?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pesquisadores ajustam fórmula tradicional de baterias de íon-lítio para alta capacidade em descargas de alta potência</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://news.google.?oc=5" class="text-m-blue-light hover:text-primary transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gamma Technologies parceira com Gotion Illinois para acelerar design de baterias de próxima geração</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Disclaimer -->
    <section class="mb-16 border-t border-hairline pt-12">
      <div class="bg-surface-elevated border border-hairline p-6">
        <h3 class="text-title-lg text-primary mb-3">Aviso Legal</h3>
